# Walkthrough: Email, Escalation & CRM Integration

This document covers testing and usage of three agent features.

---

## 1. Email Channel

**What it does:** Agents can send emails during chat conversations.

### Setup
Add to `.env`:
```
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxx
```
Get a free key at [resend.com](https://resend.com)

### How to Test
1. Start servers: `npm run dev:all`
2. Chat with an agent
3. Say: *"Send me a test email to myemail@example.com"*
4. Agent calls `send_email` tool
5. Check your inbox

### Code Location
- Tool definition: [agents.js:217-230](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/agents.js#L217-L230)
- Execution handler: [agents.js:446-478](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/agents.js#L446-L478)
- Email service: [server/resend.ts](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/resend.ts)

