## 2. Advanced Escalation

**What it does:** Agents can escalate to human support.

### How to Test
1. Chat with an agent
2. Say: *"I need to talk to a human"* or *"connect me to support"*
3. Agent calls `handoff_to_human` tool
4. Session status changes to `escalated`
5. Check: **Settings → Embed Settings → Human Support → Open Support Inbox**

### What Happens
- Session marked as `escalated` in database
- Appears in escalated inbox
- (If Novu configured) Notification sent to org admin

### Code Location
- Tool definition: [agents.js:202-214](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/agents.js#L202-L214)
- Execution handler: [agents.js:391-443](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/agents.js#L391-L443)

---

## 3. CRM Integration (HubSpot)

**What it does:** Agents can create contacts in HubSpot CRM from chat leads.

### Setup
1. Add `COMPOSIO_API_KEY` to `.env`
2. Go to **Settings → Integrations**
3. Connect **HubSpot** via Composio OAuth

### How to Test
1. Chat with an agent
2. Provide lead info: *"My name is John Doe, email john@example.com, company Acme Inc"*
3. Say: *"Save my contact to CRM"* or agent auto-saves when lead collected
4. Agent calls `create_hubspot_contact` tool
5. Check HubSpot: Contact appears with name, email, company

### Verification
- Terminal shows: `[Agent][HubSpot] Creating contact: john@example.com`
- HubSpot dashboard shows new contact
- If notes provided, engagement/note is also created

### Code Location
- Tool definition: [agents.js:232-250](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/agents.js#L232-L250)
- Execution handler: [agents.js:480-540](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/agents.js#L480-L540)
- Composio service: [server/lib/composio.js](file:///Users/shahidhasan/createHalal/write-ai/write-verse-hub/server/lib/composio.js)

