## Environment Variables Summary

| Variable | Required For | How to Get |
|----------|--------------|------------|
| `RESEND_API_KEY` | Email Channel | [resend.com](https://resend.com) |
| `COMPOSIO_API_KEY` | CRM Integration | [composio.dev](https://composio.dev) |
| `NOVU_API_KEY` | Escalation Notifications | [novu.co](https://novu.co) |
